        ],
        "text": "The government ordered the removal of petitioner Agusto Niz\u2011Chavez and sent him a first document with the charges, followed two months later by a second document giving the time and place of his hearing."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice KAVANAUGH",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dd9c73c93a20ee79412ce7b1086ff968685e3e4a30812095f8302ee4e2dd7ea7",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-dd9c73c93a20-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice KAVANAUGH, the Court asked whether the written notice required by \u00a7\u202f1229(a) was satisfied by the two documents that the government had sent."
      }
    ],
    "heading": "Background and Question",
    "status": "complete",
