              "end": 68,
              "start": 68
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kavanaugh, justice Kavanaugh sought clarification on whether, if the immigration judge rejected cancellation of removal, the removal would still be discretionary rather than mandatory."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Barrett",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "dd9c73c93a20ee79412ce7b1086ff968685e3e4a30812095f8302ee4e2dd7ea7",
